{"id":"881fccdc7af5ace3","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-preservation.md","title":"存在句与全称句的保持性","display":"thm-preservation — 存在句与全称句的保持性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-preservation","aliases":["29-thm-preservation"],"display":"thm-preservation — 存在句与全称句的保持性","depends_on":["[[29-df-substructure]]","[[29-df-universal-existential]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"本地推导；原书 §1.1 的子结构与满足概念","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-preservation — 存在句与全称句的保持性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c407bfcc6de5b0d\" href=\"?note=6c407bfcc6de5b0d\" title=\"29-df-substructure\">29-df-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52acb2f008e0c3ff\" href=\"?note=52acb2f008e0c3ff\" title=\"29-df-universal-existential\">29-df-universal-existential</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"本地推导；原书 §1.1 的子结构与满足概念"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq_\\tau B\">\\(A\\subseteq_\\tau B\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6c407bfcc6de5b0d\" href=\"?note=6c407bfcc6de5b0d\" title=\"29-df-substructure\">29-df-substructure</a> 的诱导子结构关系；函数和常量均保持。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Existential}[\\tau],\\mathrm{Universal}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{Existential}[\\tau],\\mathrm{Universal}[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"52acb2f008e0c3ff\" href=\"?note=52acb2f008e0c3ff\" title=\"29-df-universal-existential\">29-df-universal-existential</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\)</span> 与满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Existential}[\\tau]\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\quad(A\\subseteq_\\tau B\\land A\\models\\varphi\\to B\\models\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Existential}[\\tau]\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\quad(A\\subseteq_\\tau B\\land A\\models\\varphi\\to B\\models\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Universal}[\\tau]\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\quad(A\\subseteq_\\tau B\\land B\\models\\varphi\\to A\\models\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Universal}[\\tau]\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\quad(A\\subseteq_\\tau B\\land B\\models\\varphi\\to A\\models\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是基于所列定义的局部证明，未把有限模型上的逆向保存定理作为本条内容。项的解释在子结构上不变；由关系的限制条件，原子式及其否定在同一子结构赋值下同真，故所有无量词式同真。存在句在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中的见证也属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>；全称句在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 成立时对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中的所有元组也成立。原条量化全部存在/全称公式却省略自由变量赋值，现限制到闭句，使两式的满足关系完整。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"6c407bfcc6de5b0d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-universal-existential","status":"resolved","id":"52acb2f008e0c3ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-universal-existential]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolv